++Visual inspection: a freshly bundled component fixture produced `/tmp/arrival-r3-1536.png` and `/tmp/arrival-r3-390.png` with the owner sources. The knee holes and detached boots are concealed, face/#17 remain visible, and stadium texture and ground show behind the collage. These are isolated fixture screenshots with fallback Arial and no site header, not final integration screenshots; controller should verify real fonts, pin and header after rebuilding. `npx tsc --noEmit` and scoped eslint passed; `npx playwright test tests/e2e/arrival-campaign.spec.ts --project=desktop-chromium --grep 'unpublished photo fixture' --workers=1` passed. Controller owns the integrated 40-check rerun and visual review.
